    <UCAPCONTENT><p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-align:center" align="center"><span style="font-size:22.0pt;font-family:方正小标宋简体">镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-align:center" align="center"><span style="font-size:22.0pt;font-family:方正小标宋简体">2026</span><span style="font-size:
22.0pt;font-family:方正小标宋简体">年编外用工公开招聘公告</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">根据《关于规范和加强全区机关、事业单位编外用工管理的办法（试行）》（镇徒办</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体">〔</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">2018</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:宋体">〕</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">122</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">号）文件精神，结合单位编外用工岗位空缺情况和工作需要，镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心面向社会公开招聘编外用工<span>2</span>人。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">一、报考条件、对象</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（一）具有中华人民共和国国籍；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（二）年龄一般为<span>18</span>周岁以上、<span>38</span>周岁以下（<span>1987</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>17</span>日至<span>2008</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>16</span>日之间出生<span>)</span>；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（三）遵守中华人民共和国宪法和法律，拥护中国共产党领导和社会主义制度；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（四）品行良好，无违法违纪行为；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（五）具备岗位所需的专业和技能条件；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（六）适应岗位要求的身体条件；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（七）招聘岗位、人数和所要求的学历、专业等资格条件详见《镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心<span>2026</span>年编外用工公开招聘岗位表》（附件）；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（八）取得祖国大陆普通高校学历的台湾学生和取得祖国大陆承认学历的其他台湾居民应聘时按国家和江苏省的有关规定执行。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">二、应聘报名与审查</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（一）报名时间、方式</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">本次公开招聘采用网络报名方式，报名、照片上传与审核、资格初审均通过网络进行。报名网址：镇江市人事考试考工服务平台（<span>http://hrss.zhenjiang.gov.cn/ks/</span>，下简称市人事考试考工服务平台）。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">1.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">报名、照片上传时间：<span>2026</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>17</span>日<span>9:00-8</span>月<span>21</span>日<span>16:00</span>；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">2.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">资格初审时间：<span>2026</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>17</span>日<span>9:00-8</span>月<span>22</span>日<span>16:00</span>；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">3.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">陈述申辩时间：<span>2026</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>17</span>日<span>-8</span>月<span>23</span>日期间<span>9:00-16:00</span>；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">4.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">对初审异议的处理时间：<span>2026</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>17</span>日<span>9:00-8</span>月<span>24</span>日<span>18:00</span>；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（二）网上确认</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">1.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">应聘人员在网上如实提交报名信息和照片后，<span>24</span>小时后可到报名网站查询是否通过资格初审和照片审核，<span>8</span>月<span>21</span>日下午提交报名信息和照片的，应及时到报名网站查询是否通过审核。如对初审意见有异议，请及时向负责资格审核的招聘单位或招聘单位主管部门陈述申辩，联系方式详见招聘《岗位表》中相应岗位的报名咨询电话。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">2.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">只有资格审核和电子照片审核都通过（报名是否成功以报名系统中的最终状态为准），网上报名方视为成功。请考生及时查看自己的审核状态。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">3.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">规定时间内未在网上确认报名资格、上传照片的视为报名无效。逾期不再提供报名服务。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（三）核减或取消岗位</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">报名截止后，如果不能满足招聘岗位需求需要核减或取消岗位的，将在市人事考试考工服务平台发布公告核减、取消该招聘岗位。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（四）准考证的打印和使用</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">通过资格初审的应聘人员，须在<span>2026</span>年<span>9</span>月<span>2</span>日<span>9</span>：<span>00</span>起登录市人事考试考工服务平台下载、打印准考证。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（五）报名注意事项</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">1.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">应聘人员须按岗位要求和网上提示，如实填写报名信息，并上传本人近期免冠正面二寸（<span>35</span>×<span>45</span>毫米）证件照（<span>jpg</span>格式，大小为<span>20Kb</span>以下）。招聘单位根据《岗位表》中所要求的资格条件对应聘人员的报名信息进行审核。应聘人员须对照招聘岗位要求如实填报个人信息，所填专业须与毕业证书上专业完全一致，并且真实、准确、完整地填写简历等个人信息。资格审查工作贯穿于招聘工作全过程。在招聘各个环节，如发现应聘人员报名时填报信息不实、不符合资格条件、弄虚作假骗取应聘资格的，将及时终止或取消考试（聘用）资格。对存在恶意注册报名信息、扰乱报名秩序或者伪造学历证明及其他有关材料骗取考试资格等严重违纪违规行为的，将按照有关规定处理。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">如对资格初审结论有异议的，请在<span>2026</span>年<span>8</span>月<span>23</span>日<span>16</span>：<span>00</span>前向镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心及其主管部门陈述申辩。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">2.</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">应聘人员在网上报名、照片审核和打印准考证过程中如有问题，请与市人事考试考工中心联系，联系电话：<span>0511-84425552</span>。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">三、资格审查</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（一）资格初审</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心在网上对应聘人员填写的信息进行资格初审，并在应聘人员报名<span>24</span>小时内提出审核意见。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（二）资格复审</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">笔试成绩公布后对入围下一轮测试的人员组织资格复审，具体时间、地点另行通知。镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心对照公告和《岗位表》所要求的报名资格条件，审核应聘人员报名材料原件（并提供复印件一份）。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">资格复审内容为报名所需资格条件的证书或证明等材料原件。取得国（境）外学历学位的人员，除报名资格条件中要求的材料外，还需提供教育部留学回国人员学历认证和所修课程目录。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">资格条件中有工作经历要求的，应提供工作单位的工作证明，需加盖出具证明单位公章。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">通过资格复审人员名单在市人事考试考工服务平台公告，资格复审不通过或在规定时间内不参加复审的应聘人员，取消入围下一轮测试资格，并在报考同岗位的应聘人员中按从高分到低分的顺序依次递补人选。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">在<span>3</span>:<span>1</span>范围内的应聘人员，以及其他排名靠前的人员，请在成绩公布后保持联系方式畅通，以便通知资格复审或递补，无法联系者视为自动放弃。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">四、考试</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（一）考试方法和内容</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">考试采用笔试和面试相结合的方式进行。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">笔试为闭卷形式，内容为新闻专业知识、全媒体新闻活动的策划与采写等；面试为结构化面试，重点考察应聘人员的综合素质。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">考试不指定辅导用书。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（二）成绩的计算方法</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">考试均采取百分制，成绩保留<span>2</span>位小数，笔试成绩以<span>50</span>分为合格线，在笔试合格人员中，根据笔试成绩从高到低的顺序，按照与拟招聘人数<span>3</span>:<span>1</span>的比例，确定各岗位参加面试人选。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">面试成绩以<span>60</span>分为合格线；总成绩按照笔试成绩占<span>40%</span>、面试成绩占<span>60%</span>计算合成。总成绩以<span>60</span>分为最低合格线，未达合格线者不得进入下一轮。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">（三）考试时间及成绩查询</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">笔试时间：<span>2026</span>年<span>9</span>月<span>6</span>日；考试具体时间和地点见准考证。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">阅卷结束后，笔试成绩以百分制的形式在市人事考试考工服务平台公布，应聘人员可凭身份证号和准考证号查询。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">面试具体时间、地点由镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心负责通知，面试成绩当场通知考生。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">考试时间如遇特殊情况需要调整，将在市人事考试考工服务平台另行发布公告。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">五、体检和考察</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">在考试合格分数线内的人员，按各岗位招聘计划<span>1</span>:<span>1</span>的比例按总成绩由高到低确定进入体检、考察人选。如招聘岗位人数末位出现总成绩同分，以笔试成绩高者入围；如笔试成绩也相同，则加试确定名次。体检、考察工作由招聘单位或招聘单位主管部门参照普通公务员录用体检和考察标准组织进行。因体检、考察不合格等原因出现招聘岗位空缺时，由招聘单位提出是否递补的意见，报招聘单位主管部门审核。如递补，在该岗位成绩合格人员中，按总成绩从高到低的顺序依次递补，录用审批或备案后不再递补。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">六、聘用</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">体检、考察合格的人员，经审核后在市人事考试考工服务平台公示。公示期满无异议的，按有关规定程序签订劳动合同。拟聘用人员在规定时间内办结相关手续，逾期视作自动放弃。试用期为<span>3</span>个月。聘用人员待遇按单位相关规定执行，享受所在单位编制外社会化用工相关待遇，并按规定缴纳“五险一金”（养老保险、医疗保险、失业保险、工伤保险、生育保险和住房公积金）。具体待遇考生报名时可电话咨询镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">拟聘用人员与招聘单位订立<span>3</span>年以上（含试用期）聘用合同的，除依法依规解除聘用合同外，应当在招聘单位最低服务<span>3</span>年（含试用期）。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">七、其他</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">本次集中公开招聘工作，坚持“公开、平等、竞争、择优”的原则，接受纪检监察部门和社会公众的监督。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">工作日政策咨询电话：<span>0511-87052257</span>（镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心）；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">工作日考务咨询：<span>0511-84425552</span>（镇江市人事考试考工中心）；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">工作日监督电话：<span>0511- 80873651</span>（镇江市丹徒区纪委监委派驻组织部纪检监察组）。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">本公告由镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心负责解释。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312"><br>
</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:等线;text-indent:32.0pt"><img border="0" src="6a5c202baf434289952901f19c54bf7f/images/b37c8e4eb477410bb5928ecd526ed228.gif"><a href="6a5c202baf434289952901f19c54bf7f/files/90b47ab042f24fe38499534a2fb94c74.docx" target="_blank">附件：镇江市丹徒区融媒体中心2026年编外用工公开招聘岗位表</a><br>
</p></UCAPCONTENT>
